
Uhlu uma-kufika: ['product'] yenza: {
	>> total := 1.
	uqobo ngamunye: { :index :element
		total phindaphinda-ngo: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Uhlu ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
Okuphumayo bhala: a product, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (Uhlu ← 2 ; 4 ; 8) product, umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (Uhlu ← -2 ; 10) product, umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (Uhlu ← 0.5 ; -2) product, umugqa-omusha. 
